    "\\vec E_\\perp=\\frac{i}{\\gamma^2}\\Big(k_z\\nabla_\\perp E_z-\\frac{\\omega}{c}\\mu\\,\\hat{\\mathbf z}\\times\\nabla_\\perp H_z\\Big),\\qquad\n",
    "\\vec H_\\perp=\\frac{i}{\\gamma^2}\\Big(k_z\\nabla_\\perp H_z+\\frac{\\omega}{c}\\varepsilon\\,\\hat{\\mathbf z}\\times\\nabla_\\perp E_z\\Big),\n",
    "$$\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(\\nabla_\\perp^2+\\gamma^2)E_z=0,\\qquad(\\nabla_\\perp^2+\\gamma^2)H_z=0 .\n",
